# Deny everything, then allow only what the alert image needs. Keeping the
# context this small means secrets, databases, and caches are never sent to the
# Docker daemon or baked into a layer.
**
!Dockerfile
!mudah-finder
!mudah-finder/mudah.py
!mudah-alerts
!mudah-alerts/mudah_alerts.py

# Belt-and-braces exclusions if an allow glob is ever widened.
.env
.env.*
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.lock
__pycache__/
.graymatter/
*.xlsx
